    "desc": "Comprehensive guide to what nobody tells you about annapurna base camp trek. Detailed itineraries, trail elevations, costs, avalanche zones, permit rules, and Sherpa pro-tips.",
    "lead": "Instagram reels and glossy agency brochures make the Annapurna Base Camp (ABC) trek look like a seamless stroll through dreamy alpine meadows punctuated by gentle sunrise hot chocolates. While standing inside the 360-degree natural amphitheater of Annapurna I, Machapuchare, and Hiunchuli is undeniably one of the most sublime spiritual and visual experiences on Earth, getting there involves gritty, unglamorous realities that few travel influencers mention. You will ascend and descend over 6,000 unforgiving hand-carved stone stairs that punish knees and quadriceps, sleep in uninsulated plywood cubicles where every neighbor's cough reverberates, negotiate frozen squat toilets with icy buckets at 3,700 meters, and pay escalating surcharges for hot water and battery charging. Having guided hundreds of international hikers through the Modi Khola gorge over two decades, our lead guides share the 14 raw, unvarnished truths you genuinely need to know to prepare mentally, physically, and financially for the trek of a lifetime.",
