    "lead": "Venturing into kanchenjunga circuit trek autumn weather requires meticulous planning—special restricted area permits (RAP), certified mountain guides, seasonal road access, and authentic teahouse etiquette. Curated by our senior expedition leaders at Igloo Himalaya Treks, here is the complete insider guide.",
    "readingTime": "20 min read",
