        "answer": "The standard round-trip trek from Lukla to Gokyo Lake and Gokyo Ri measures exactly 92 kilometers (57.1 miles). Adding side trips to the Fourth Lake (Thonak Tsho) and Fifth Lake (Ngozumpa Tsho) adds another 12 to 14 kilometers, bringing the total distance to approximately 104 to 106 kilometers."
