        "answer": "A standard 11- to 13-day fully guided Gokyo Lakes trek package costs between $1,350 and $1,850 USD per person. This includes round-trip Lukla flights, permits, guide, porter, teahouse lodging, and three daily meals. Independent trekkers organizing local logistics can budget roughly $950 to $1,300 USD."
