    "lead": "Trekking to Mount Everest Base Camp (5,364m / 17,598ft) is a monumental high-altitude journey requiring disciplined acclimatization, precise pacing, and up-to-date 2027 trail logistics. Based on hundreds of successful guided expeditions led by senior Sherpa leaders at Igloo Himalaya Treks, here is the ultimate, day-by-day master itinerary designed for a 98% summit and safety success rate.",
    "readingTime": "34 min read",
    "publishedDateText": "Oct 4, 2026",
    "publishedDateAttr": "2026-10-04",
