        "content": "\n        <figure class=\"article-figure\">\n          <img src=\"../images/traditional-nepal-teahouse-dal-bhat-thali.webp\" alt=\"Authentic Nepalese culinary traditions and mountain travel culture\" class=\"article-figure-img\" width=\"1200\" height=\"700\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n          <figcaption class=\"article-figure-caption\">\n            Experiencing the rich living culture, ancient heritage traditions, and vibrant Himalayan hospitality of Nepal.\n          </figcaption>\n        </figure>\n        <p>\n          Traveling through Nepal is an extraordinary sensory adventure. Understanding <strong>Nepal Flood 2026 Trekking Routes Affected</strong> empowers you to travel with confidence, cultural respect, and practical self-reliance. From the bustling medieval alleys of Kathmandu to remote Himalayan mountain hamlets, Nepal offers a warm and welcoming environment for international adventurers.\n        </p>\n        <p>\n          Whether your journey involves scaling high glaciated trekking peaks like Island Peak (6,189m), sampling steaming brass plates of Dal Bhat in family-run teahouses, or navigating the latest governmental visa and drone guidelines, having up-to-date local facts prevents common tourist misconceptions.\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"editorial-callout\">\n          <div class=\"editorial-callout-title\">\n            <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--color-primary)\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"12\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"12.01\" y2=\"16\"/></svg>\n            <span>Local Traveler Tip: The Spirit of \"Namaste\"</span>\n          </div>\n          <p>\n            \"Greet locals with hands pressed together at chest height and a warm 'Namaste' ('I bow to the divine within you'). This simple traditional gesture opens hearts, builds instant trust, and reflects genuine cultural appreciation across Nepal.\"\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      "
