        "id": "monthly-weather-matrix-temperature-and-rainfall-matrix",
        "h2": "4. Month-by-Month Temperature, Precipitation & Daylight Hours Matrix (Pokhara vs ABC)",
        "content": "\n        <p>Below is empirical meteorological data comparing temperatures, precipitation, and sunshine hours between Lakeside Pokhara (820 m) and Annapurna Base Camp (4,130 m):</p>\n\n        <div class=\"table-responsive\">\n          <table class=\"guide-data-table\">\n            <thead>\n              <tr>\n                <th>Month</th>\n                <th>Pokhara Avg Temp</th>\n                <th>ABC Max Temp</th>\n                <th>ABC Min (Night) Temp</th>\n                <th>Rainfall (mm)</th>\n                <th>Sunny Days / Month</th>\n              </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n              <tr>\n                <td>January</td>\n                <td>19°C / 7°C</td>\n                <td>2°C (36°F)</td>\n                <td>-15°C (5°F)</td>\n                <td>22 mm (Snow)</td>\n                <td>25 days</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td>February</td>\n                <td>22°C / 9°C</td>\n                <td>4°C (39°F)</td>\n                <td>-12°C (10°F)</td>\n                <td>28 mm (Snow)</td>\n                <td>23 days</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td>March</td>\n                <td>26°C / 13°C</td>\n                <td>8°C (46°F)</td>\n                <td>-8°C (18°F)</td>\n                <td>45 mm (Mixed)</td>\n                <td>24 days</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td>April</td>\n                <td>30°C / 17°C</td>\n                <td>12°C (54°F)</td>\n                <td>-4°C (25°F)</td>\n                <td>75 mm (Rain/Hail)</td>\n                <td>22 days</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td>May</td>\n                <td>31°C / 20°C</td>\n                <td>15°C (59°F)</td>\n                <td>0°C (32°F)</td>\n                <td>160 mm (Rain)</td>\n                <td>18 days</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td>June</td>\n                <td>31°C / 22°C</td>\n                <td>17°C (63°F)</td>\n                <td>4°C (39°F)</td>\n                <td>380 mm (Heavy)</td>\n                <td>9 days</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td>July</td>\n                <td>30°C / 23°C</td>\n                <td>18°C (64°F)</td>\n                <td>6°C (43°F)</td>\n                <td>650 mm (Monsoon)</td>\n                <td>5 days</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td>August</td>\n                <td>30°C / 23°C</td>\n                <td>17°C (63°F)</td>\n                <td>5°C (41°F)</td>\n                <td>580 mm (Monsoon)</td>\n                <td>6 days</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td>September</td>\n                <td>29°C / 21°C</td>\n                <td>15°C (59°F)</td>\n                <td>2°C (36°F)</td>\n                <td>240 mm (Clearing)</td>\n                <td>16 days</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td>October</td>\n                <td>27°C / 15°C</td>\n                <td>11°C (52°F)</td>\n                <td>-5°C (23°F)</td>\n                <td>40 mm (Dry)</td>\n                <td>27 days</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td>November</td>\n                <td>24°C / 11°C</td>\n                <td>7°C (45°F)</td>\n                <td>-10°C (14°F)</td>\n                <td>12 mm (Dry)</td>\n                <td>28 days</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td>December</td>\n                <td>20°C / 8°C</td>\n                <td>4°C (39°F)</td>\n                <td>-14°C (7°F)</td>\n                <td>15 mm (Snow)</td>\n                <td>26 days</td>\n              </tr>\n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n        </div>\n      "
