        "question": "Is 9 days enough time for the Annapurna Base Camp trek?",
        "answer": "Yes! The 9-day itinerary (7 trekking days + 2 travel/contingency days from Pokhara) is ideal for reasonably fit hikers. By driving directly to and from roadheads like Siwai, you bypass days of dusty road walking and focus on the pristine mountain trails."
