    "lead": "Planning everest base camp trek guide tips requires precise local knowledge of Khumbu altitude safety, seasonal weather patterns, packing strategies, and teahouse logistics. Curated by 5x Everest summitter Ang Tshering Sherpa and our certified team, here is the complete insider guide.",
    "readingTime": "22 min read",
    "publishedDateText": "Oct 4, 2026",
    "publishedDateAttr": "2026-10-04",
    "updatedDateText": "Oct 5, 2026",
