        "content": "\n        <p>\n          Here is a reference summary of key parameters, regulatory requirements, and practical tips relevant to this topic:\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"guide-data-table-wrap\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Reference Guidelines Table\">\n          <table class=\"guide-data-table\">\n            <thead>\n              <tr>\n                <th>Category</th>\n                <th>Standard Policy / Specification</th>\n                <th>Expert Recommendation</th>\n              </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n              <tr>\n                <td><strong>Documentation & Permits</strong></td>\n                <td>Official government permits required across all national parks and conservation areas</td>\n                <td>Always arrange permits through a registered agency; carry physical passport copies</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td><strong>Seasonal Timing</strong></td>\n                <td>Peak Spring (March–May) and Autumn (September–November)</td>\n                <td>Book flights and mountain guides 3 to 6 months in advance for peak periods</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td><strong>Currency & Payments</strong></td>\n                <td>Nepali Rupee (NPR); cash strictly required outside major cities</td>\n                <td>Carry small-denomination notes (NPR 100, 500) for tea stops, tipping, and local stalls</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td><strong>Safety & Communication</strong></td>\n                <td>Local SIM cards (NTC / Ncell) available at airport; emergency rescue insurance recommended</td>\n                <td>Ensure travel insurance includes helicopter evacuation up to 6,000 meters</td>\n              </tr>\n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n        </div>\n      "
