    "quickAnswerContent": "\n    <p><strong>Essential Takeaway:</strong> Whether preparing for your first arrival in Kathmandu, mastering local dining etiquette, or navigating national park drone permits, preparation ensures a smooth, respectful, and safe journey.</p>\n    <p><strong>Key Logistics:</strong> Tourist visas are easily obtained on arrival at Tribhuvan International Airport ($30 for 15 days, $50 for 30 days, $125 for 90 days). Keep sufficient cash (NPR or USD) on hand for rural travel.</p>\n    <p><strong>Cultural Etiquette:</strong> Always remove your shoes before entering temples and private homes, dress modestly, use your right hand when giving or receiving items, and respect local sacred monuments by walking clockwise.</p>\n  ",
