        "answer": "Yes, February is an outstanding month for trekkers who desire clear mountain views, crisp photography conditions, and uncrowded trails. While early February retains deep winter cold at high elevations, late February brings lengthening days, warming sunshine, and early rhododendron blooms in the lower valleys, offering a superb balance between winter tranquility and spring accessibility."
